Package: dataBiosphere
Type: Package
Title: Auditable Cinematic Metaphors for High-Risk Research Findings
Version: 0.2.0
URL: https://github.com/ahmetkutuk1/dataBiosphere, https://ahmetkutuk1.github.io/dataBiosphere/
BugReports: https://github.com/ahmetkutuk1/dataBiosphere/issues
Authors@R:
    person("Ahmet", "Kutuk",
           email = "ahmetkutuk@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts high-risk research findings (health, finance,
    regulation) into auditable cinematic video and interactive simulation.
    Provides a deterministic metaphor matrix (S1-S12 across fluvial,
    arboreal and celestial families) and a truth-overlay generator that keeps
    literal findings (effect size, 95% CI, n) visible in every frame, in line
    with the Freeze-Frame Test and the Faithfulness Constraint.
